2026-02-15 14:22:33,877 [DEBUG] anthropic._base_client: Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-154025b5-50c3-4c10-bd57-7a5f4949d4f4', 'content': None, 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 256, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Analyze this job listing and extract the following fields. Return ONLY valid JSON, no other text.\n\nJob Title: Compliance Oversight Lead\nOrganization: Anthropic\nLocation: San Francisco, CA | New York City, NY | Washington, DC\nDescription:\n&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Compliance Oversight Lead to build and lead the operational infrastructure that enables Anthropic&#39;s Integrity &amp;amp; Compliance (I&amp;amp;C) function to operate effectively. This role is responsible for the systems, processes, and reporting mechanisms that support all compliance pillars—ensuring consistency, visibility, and accountability across the function.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Our global compliance program is bespoke, reflecting our unique mission and position as one of the leading AI labs operating on the frontier. Our Compliance Oversight pillar comprises a key pillar of our overall Integrity and Compliance function. Compliance Oversight will create and maintain the frameworks, policies, and oversight mechanisms that enable Anthropic to meet its commitments to employees, customers, regulators, and the public—building trust through demonstrated accountability as the company scales.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Own the compliance training program, working with subject matter experts across I&amp;amp;C to develop, deliver, and track completion of training that meets both regulatory requirements and organizational needs&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Manage the policy lifecycle—from drafting and approval workflows through version control, attestation, and accessibility—ensuring Anthropic&#39;s policies are current, coherent, and demonstrably communicated to employees&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Lead implementation and administration of a GRC system for Integrity &amp;amp; Compliance to serve as the central platform for compliance activities, including risk tracking, control documentation, and workflow management&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Design and execute testing and monitoring programs for key compliance controls, working with pillar SMEs to verify controls are functioning as intended and identify gaps before they become issues&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Coordinate responses to compliance-related due diligence requests from customers, partners, and investors&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Own issue management and tracking, ensuring compliance findings, exceptions, and remediation efforts are documented, assigned, and driven to closure with appropriate escalation&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Manage compliance vendor relationships and the I&amp;amp;C budget, providing the administrative foundation for the function&#39;s operations&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt\n\nReturn a JSON object with exactly these keys:\n- "work_mode": one of "Remote (Global)", "Remote (US)", "Remote (EU)", "Hybrid", "In-Person", or null if unclear\n- "visa_sponsorship": true, false, or null if not mentioned\n- "seniority_level": one of "Entry", "Mid", "Senior", "All Levels", or null if unclear\n\nRules:\n- "Entry" = internship, fellowship, junior, entry-level, 0-2 years experience\n- "Mid" = mid-level, 3-7 years experience\n- "Senior" = senior, lead, director, head, principal, 8+ years experience\n- "All Levels" = explicitly states open to multiple levels\n- For work_mode, if it says "remote" without geographic restriction, use "Remote (Global)"\n- For visa_sponsorship, only set true/false if explicitly mentioned'}], 'model': 'claude-haiku-4-5'}}
