b272e26242d372c2623362b2d2c6c2d3025"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="f1839492838498859c949f85b19f84979798949d95979e849f959085989e9fdf9e8396">[email\xa0protected]</span></a>.</p>\n<p>We are an employer that values the diversity of its workforce and welcome applications from all sections of the community.</p>\n<p><a href="https://twitter.com/AdaLovelaceInst">Follow us on Twitter</a> or <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/66883451">LinkedIn</a> and <a href="https://t.co/lTk3R2LxwO">join our mailing list</a> to stay informed about future opportunities at Ada.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class="c-listing o-section js-filters" id="listing">\n<div class="c-listing__container o-container">\n<h2 class="c-listing__title">Current vacancies</h2>\n<div class="c-listing__filters-wrapper js-filters-mobile-wrapper">\n<div class="c-listing__filters">\n<h3 class="c-listing__filters-title">Filter by:</h3>\n<section class="c-filters js-filters">\n<form action="#listing" class="c-filters__form js-filters__form" method="get">\n<div class="c-filters__filter c-filters__filter--keywords-container js-filters__filter">\n<button class="c-filters__filter__heading js-filters__filter__heading" type="button">\n                Keywords<span class="c-filters__filter__heading__icon"></span>\n</button>\n<ul class="c-filters__filter__list c-filters__filter__list--keywords js-filters__filter__list">\n<li class="c-filters__filter__list__item c-filters__filter__list__item--checkbox accountability-mechanisms js-filters__filter__list__item">\n<input class="c-filters__filter__list__item__checkbox js-filters__filter__list__item__checkbox" id="keywords-accountability-mechanisms" name="select-keywords[]" type="checkbox" value="accountability-mechanisms"/>\n<label class="c-filters__filter__list__item__label js-filters__filter__list__item__label" for="keywords-accountability-mechanisms">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAccountability mechanisms\t\t\t\t\t\t</label>\n</li>\n<li class="c-filters__filter_