to meet the needs of you and your family.</p>\n</div>\n<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:66.66%">\n<div class="wp-block-group is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-7a4448cc wp-block-group-is-layout-grid">\n<div class="wp-block-group is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow" style="border-top-color:#1b162130;border-top-width:2px;border-right-style:none;border-right-width:0px;border-bottom-style:none;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-style:none;border-left-width:0px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--medium);padding-bottom:0">\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-h5-variant" id="h-time-off-amp-leave">Time Off &amp; Leave</h3>\n<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-28f84493 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">\n<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li class="">13 Paid Holidays</li>\n<li class="">1 Floating Day</li>\n<li class="">2 Cultural Heritage Days</li>\n<li class="">Charitable Leave (one day to volunteer for Charitable/Civic Engagement)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li class="">Vacation Leave</li>\n<li class="">Sick Leave</li>\n<li class="">Paid Family Leave</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="wp-block-group is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow" style="border-top-color:#1b162130;border-top-width:2px;border-right-style:none;border-right-width:0px;border-bottom-style:none;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-style:none;border-left-width:0px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--medium);padding-bottom:0">\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-h5-variant" id="h-health-amp-wellness">Health &amp; Wellness</h3>\n<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-28f84493 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">\n<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li class="">Medical/Dental/Vision Coverage</li>\n<li class="">Prescription Coverage</li>\n<li class="">Life Insurance / Accidental Death &amp; Dismemberment (ADD)</li>\n<li class="">Long Term Care Insurance</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li class="">Short-term &amp; Long-term Disability</li>\n<li class="">Employee Assistance Program (EAP)</li>\n<li class=""><a href="https://www.cigna.com/legal/compliance/machine-readable-files">Important information regarding our health plan’s Machine-Readable Files (MRF)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class="has-xsmall-variant">(This link leads to the machine-readable files that are made available in response to the federal Transparency in Coverage Rule and include in-network negotiated service rates and out-of-network allowed amounts between health plans and healthcare providers. The machine-readable files are formatted to allow researchers, regulators, and application developers to more easily access and analyze data.)</p>\n</div>\n<div class="wp-block-group is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow" style="border-top-color:#1b162130;border-top-width:2px;border-right-style:none;border-right-width:0px;border-bottom-style:none;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-style:none;border-left-width:0px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--medium);padding-bottom:0">\n<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-28f84493 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">\n<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-h5-variant" id="h-financial-benefits">Financial Benefits</h3>\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li class="">Tax Deferred and Defined Contribution Retirement Plans (including employee match and generous employer contribution)</li>\n<li class="">Flexible Spending Account (FSA)</li>\n<li class="">Health Savings Account (HSA)\xa0</li>\n<li class="">Tuition Reimbursement</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-h5-variant" id="h-additional-perks">Additional Perks</h3>\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li class="">Employee-led Affinity Groups</li>\n<li class="">Training and Development Opportunities</li>\n<li class="">Transportation and/or BikeShare Subsidy (BikeShare for DC Employees)</li>\n<li class="">Discounted Ski Passes (Aspen, Colorado Employees)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="wp-block-group alignfull has-white-background-color has-background is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained" style="padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--small)">\n<div class="alignwide cta cta--large is-style-contour-lines has-primary-background-color has-background"><div class="cta__layout">\n<div class="cta__content">\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading has-h4-variant" id="h-explore-our-career-opportunities">Explore Our Career Opportunities</h4>\n<p class="">With over 40 programs, we always have a variety of job opportunities that might be of interest to you. If you would enjoy working in a dynamic environment and are passionate about solving the most important challenges facing the United States and the world, we just might have a spot for you! </p>\n</div>\n<div class="wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex">\n<div class="wp-block-button is-style-default"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="https://www.aspeninstitute.org/about/our-careers/career-opportunities/">View Job Openings<span class="wp-block-button__effect"></span></a></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div></main>'}], 'model': 'claude-haiku-4-5'}}
